{"4568220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Panchofobia", "steam_appid": 4568220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4906310], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GLIZZY KILLER IS LOOSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PANCHOFOBIA </strong>is a horror game with puzzles and action, featuring a low-poly art style (not to be confused with low effort).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Francisco is a young man wandering the streets at 3 a.m. when hunger starts to set in. He goes out to buy a hot dog to satisfy his appetite, but the shopkeeper who serves him warns <strong>If you eat a hot dog now, it could cost you dearly…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Argentina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative focused horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With CRT filter for extra grime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde mode that is unlocked after beating the campaign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568220/extras/9877a5416ac88ce77e80deb290f1012f.poster.avif?t=1787016068\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568220/extras/9877a5416ac88ce77e80deb290f1012f.webm?t=1787016068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime between 1-2 hours depending on pace.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GLIZZY KILLER IS LOOSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PANCHOFOBIA </strong>is a horror game with puzzles and action, featuring a low-poly art style (not to be confused with low effort).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Francisco is a young man wandering the streets at 3 a.m. when hunger starts to set in. He goes out to buy a hot dog to satisfy his appetite, but the shopkeeper who serves him warns <strong>If you eat a hot dog now, it could cost you dearly…</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Argentina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative focused horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With CRT filter for extra grime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person view</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde mode that is unlocked after beating the campaign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568220/extras/9877a5416ac88ce77e80deb290f1012f.poster.avif?t=1787016068\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568220/extras/9877a5416ac88ce77e80deb290f1012f.webm?t=1787016068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average playtime between 1-2 hours depending on pace.</p>", "short_description": "You head out to buy a hot dog in the dead of night… but that simple snack ends up dragging you into a web of increasingly unsettling secrets. You soon find yourself face to face with a cult that worships hot dogs, and you’ll have to do everything you can to survive and escape this nightmare.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568220/24f34f25934de47f6563409793d71ebb9ccbd